WEBVTT

NOTE
install-windows.mp4 carries no audio stream at all (one video stream, no
audio), so there is no speech or sound to caption. Its instructions are burned
into the picture in English for the film's whole length, so an English track
repeating them would print the same sentence twice over the frame. These cues
describe each click instead, in the reader's language, and the track is
offered in the captions menu rather than forced on. The clip is silent, so the
first cue says so.

silent
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
(no audio, this demo is silent)

moreinfo
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.250
Click "More info" on the Windows warning.

runanyway
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:04.950
Then click "Run anyway".

uac
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.350
Windows asks for permission: click Yes to allow the install.

next
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.300
Click Next through the installer. The defaults are fine.

blocker
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.150
WeLockIn sets up its website blocker.

finish
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.250
Keep both boxes ticked, then click Finish.

done
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.850
WeLockIn opens. You're all set.
